  "description": "PITTOD crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H85 N8 Ni2 O16 Tb3 2+,C1 H4 O1,H2 O1,2(Cl1 1-),C1 H1 Cl3. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 3 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.213-3.870 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.62-114.01°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ni2Tb3(LH)3(LH2)]Cl2·CHCl3·CH3OH·H2O.",
